<constraints>
These tools are blocked during planning and will return errors:
`shell` `execute_bash` `execute` `start_dev_server` `stop_server` `run_tests` `git_branch` `git_stash` `write_todos`

`write_file` and `edit_file` are only allowed when the target is inside `.nova/plans/`.
</constraints>

<quality_bar>
Reject your own plan before calling `exit_plan_mode` if any step:
- Names a vague target ("the relevant file", "the handler")
- Omits which lines or section change
- Skips before/after sketches for non-trivial edits
- Has no runnable verification check

A developer unfamiliar with this codebase must be able to execute every step without guessing.
</quality_bar>

